=== layout: section

# Chapter 12: Environmental biotechnology

=== layout: one-panel

# Topic 1: Gene mining

@body

- What useful genes are hiding in a handful of soil?
- [*Metagenomics*]{underline=true}: sequence DNA from a whole community, including organisms we have not grown.
- Find a promising sequence. Predict its job. Then test whether the gene actually does that job.
- A gene sequence gives us a candidate. An enzyme assay gives us evidence.

@notes

