=== layout: four-panels

# 1. From mixed DNA to a useful gene

@top-left

## 1. Sample

Collect the community and extract its DNA. Include controls for contamination.

@top-right

## 2. Assemble

Join overlapping reads into longer sequences. Mixed organisms make this harder.

@bottom-left

## 3. Sort

Group likely genome fragments into bins: metagenome-assembled genomes (MAGs).

@bottom-right

## 4. Test

Express a candidate gene and measure its activity. Is the predicted function correct?

@notes

