=== layout: one-panel

# 1. We found it. What does it do?

@body

- How does sequencing a mixed community differ from sequencing one cultured organism?
- What makes a MAG incomplete or contaminated? Can closely related strains get mixed together?
- Find one useful enzyme or human-gut discovery from metagenomics. What experiment supports the result?
- The NIH [MorPhiC program](https://www.genome.gov/news/news-release/nih-initiative-to-systematically-investigate-and-establish-function-of-every-human-gene) knocks out human genes and measures what changes. How is that different from environmental gene mining?

@notes

