# 2. A microbial name tag has limits

@body

| Method | What you get | What is missing? |
| --- | --- | --- |
| 16S amplicons | Bacterial/archaeal profile | Often limited strain resolution |
| Shotgun metagenomics | Genes across sampled genomes | Activity is still inferred |
| RNA measurements | Transcripts under these conditions | Protein activity needs testing |

@notes

