# Topic 3: Culture enrichment

@body

- Give microbes conditions that favor the activity you want. Who grows?
- [*Enrichment culture*]{underline=true} selects organisms through nutrients, temperature, oxygen, and other growth conditions.
- The textbook groups several discovery tools here. They do different jobs; they are not all ways to grow a culture.
- A fast-growing winner in a flask may have been rare in the original sample.

@notes

2026 topic 3; numbering authority: ../old/2026_topic_list.txt.
Prompt source: ../old/Fall_2026_Talking_Points_Set_4-Environmental_and_Synthetic.pptx, slide 18.
