# 3. Tools for studying environmental microbes

@body

- Stable isotope probing (SIP)
- 5-bromo-2-deoxyuridine (BrdU)
- Small subunit ribosomal RNA (SSU rRNA)
- Suppressive subtraction hybridization (SSH)

@notes

