=== layout: one-panel

# 3. Four tools, four different questions

@body

| Tool | What does it help identify? |
| --- | --- |
| SIP | Who incorporates a labeled substrate? |
| BrdU labeling | Who incorporates a DNA precursor? |
| SSU rRNA analysis | Which organisms are represented? |
| Subtractive hybridization | Which sequences differ between samples? |

@notes

