# Topic 4: Hydrocarbon remediation

@body

- For us, an oil spill is a disaster. For some microbes, it is a carbon source.
- Oxygenases can begin aerobic hydrocarbon breakdown; later reactions feed carbon into metabolism.
- [*Biostimulation*]{underline=true}: help microbes already there. [*Bioaugmentation*]{underline=true}: add organisms.
- Oil is a mixture. One microbe rarely handles every component.

@notes

