=== layout: two-panels

# 4. Two oil spills, different habitats

@left

## Exxon Valdez

- Cold Alaskan shoreline
- Nutrient addition to stimulate native microbes
- Ask what limited breakdown and how it was measured.

@right

## Deepwater Horizon

- Deep-water plumes and surface oil
- Changing hydrocarbon-degrading communities
- Ask which organisms and pathways were supported by the data.

@notes

