=== layout: one-panel

# Topic 5: Chemical spill remediation

@body

- Industrial chemicals can be microbial electron acceptors as well as contaminants.
- Some *Dehalococcoides* strains use reductive dehalogenases to remove chlorine from chlorinated solvents.
- Anaerobic and aerobic partners may be needed for different parts of a mixture.
- Getting rid of the starting chemical is only part of the job. What did it turn into?

@notes

2026 topic 5; numbering authority: ../old/2026_topic_list.txt.
Prompt source: ../old/Fall_2026_Talking_Points_Set_4-Environmental_and_Synthetic.pptx, slide 22.
