=== layout: one-panel

# 6. Design a cleanup experiment

@body

- Compare untreated soil, treatment alone, and treatment with the proposed organism or enzyme.
- Measure the parent compound, breakdown products, and toxicity over time.
- What if the pesticide sticks to soil instead of being degraded? What if a breakdown product is still toxic?
- What result would convince you that the treatment works outside a laboratory?

@notes

2026 topic 6; numbering authority: ../old/2026_topic_list.txt.
