# 10. Hydrogen or wastewater?

@body

| Question | Hydrogen fuel cell | Microbial fuel cell |
| --- | --- | --- |
| Fuel | Hydrogen | Biodegradable organic matter |
| Catalyst | Electrode catalyst | Living microbes and electrodes |
| Main challenge | Hydrogen supply and storage | Low power and biological limits |
| Possible use | Vehicle or stationary power | Waste treatment, sensors, small loads |

@notes

