=== layout: one-panel

# 11. What would you engineer?

@body

- Faster methane uptake? More carbon fixation? Better conversion into a useful chemical?
- Name the enzyme or pathway, then explain why changing it should improve the whole process.
- Count incoming carbon, outgoing carbon, and the energy used to run the system.
- How long must stored carbon stay out of the atmosphere for your proposed benefit?

@notes

