https://doi.org/10.1073/pnas.1718804115

=== layout: four-panels

# 12. Two enzymes share the work

@top-left

## PET

A polyester. Crystallinity and accessible surface affect enzyme access.

@top-right

## PETase

Cuts polymer ester bonds, producing MHET and other soluble products.

@bottom-left

## MHETase

Hydrolyzes MHET to terephthalate and ethylene glycol.

@bottom-right

## Reuse

Separate and recover the products. Can they become new material?

@notes

