# 12. Can we make the enzymes better?

@body

- Find the amino-acid changes in the 2018 PETase study. What did the experiments actually compare?
- Compare a linked MHETase-PETase chimera with the same amount of separate enzymes. Why might linking help?
- Which production organism would you use? Compare enzyme yield, stability, and the cost of purification.
- Why might a controlled recycling reactor work better than releasing an engineered microbe into the ocean?

