=== layout: one-panel

# 13. How picky is the binding site?

@body

- Compare bacteria, fungi, and algae. What do their surfaces, secreted acids, and growth conditions contribute?
- Which metals compete with the rare earths? Test iron and manganese as well as light versus heavy rare earths.
- A 2023 lanmodulin study separated neodymium and dysprosium; a 2026 study screened hundreds of variants. How can sequence changes alter selectivity?
- Can microbes help mine gold? Distinguish exposing gold in a mineral from creating gold atoms.

@notes

